{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000010934","bookName":" ¡Ups! El cumpleaños de la CEO está arruinado","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000010934/42000010934.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":150706,"followCount":7424,"introduction":"Teresa consintió a su hijo Bruno desde pequeño y jamás le puso límites. De adulto, se vuelve un joven imprudente y caprichoso: arruina la fiesta de la jefa de su padre, humilla a invitados y quema un auto de un millón mientras su madre lo permite. Ese amor ciego tiene un alto precio: Bruno arruina su futuro, destruye la carrera de su padre y acaba llevando a Teresa a prisión. Solo tras las rejas ella comprende el costo de su amor.","chapterCount":51,"labels":["Strong Female Lead","Counterattack"],"tags":["Strong Female Lead","Counterattack"],"typeTwoIds":[336],"typeTwoNames":["Contraataque"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":336,"name":"Contraataque","replaceName":"contraataque"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Contraataque","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"¡Ups-El-cumpleaños-de-la-CEO-está-arruinado","bookNameLower":"¡ups-el-cumpleaños-de-la-ceo-está-arruinado","shelfTime":"2026-05-03 10:00:01","firstShelfTime":"2026-05-03 10:00:01","performerList":[{"performerId":"12034","performerName":"Candace Mizga","performerFormatName":"Candace-Mizga","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x3/12034/12034.jpg?time=1783304434942","videoCount":9},{"performerId":"29451","performerName":"Daniel Karpik","performerFormatName":"Daniel-Karpik","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/1x5/29451/29451.jpg?time=1782456638723","videoCount":2},{"performerId":"12232","performerName":"Riley Nottingham","performerFormatName":"Riley-Nottingham","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/2x3/12232/12232.jpg?time=1790573875923","videoCount":5}],"performerIdList":[12034,12232,29451]},"chapterList":[{"id":"700702635","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwv